# The dashboard's Adversarial review action (sd:5064) reads these from
# <config>/adversarial-gate/.env. Both are optional: without them it runs
# codex with the values below. `adversarial-gate run` itself reads neither.
#
# The codex model id, passed as `codex exec -m`.
# ADVERSARIAL_MODEL=gpt-6-astra
#
# The reasoning effort, passed as `-c model_reasoning_effort=`; one lowercase
# word, such as low, medium or high.
# ADVERSARIAL_EFFORT=high

# The repo row's Deep review (sd:5100) runs headless claude instead of codex.
# All three are optional too.
#
# The claude model, passed as `claude --model`: an alias (opus, fable,
# sonnet) or a full model id.
# DEEP_MODEL=opus
#
# The effort, passed as `claude --effort`: low, medium, high, xhigh or max.
# DEEP_EFFORT=max
#
# The wall-clock bound in whole minutes; the run's process group is killed
# past it and the run reads failed.
# DEEP_TIMEOUT_MINUTES=90
